flowchart TD
    A[Problem and target metric] --> B[Collect data]
    B --> C[Train / validation / test split]
    C --> D[Baseline model]
    D --> E[Evaluate on validation set]
    E --> F{Bias vs variance?}
    F -- Underfit / high bias --> G[Add capacity or features]
    F -- Overfit / high variance --> H[Regularize or add data]
    G --> D
    H --> D
    F -- Good fit --> I[Final check on held-out test set]
    I --> J[Deploy and monitor]
    J -- Distribution shift --> B
